>> Slurp := Ntho ncha.

Slurp ha-ho-fihla: ['ncha'] etsa: {
	ea-hao str := [''].
}.


Slurp ha-ho-fihla: ['araba:'] etsa: { :blah
		(ea-hao str = ['']) nnete: {
			ea-hao str eketsa-qetellong: blah.
		}, ho-seng-joalo: {
			ea-hao str eketsa-qetellong: [' '].
			ea-hao str eketsa-qetellong: blah.
		}.
}.

Slurp ha-ho-fihla: ['araba:le:'] etsa: { :blah :blahah
		ea-hao str eketsa-qetellong: (blah ho-tloha: 0 bolelele: (blah bolelele - 1)).
		ea-hao str eketsa-qetellong: [' '].
		ea-hao str eketsa-qetellong: blahah.
}.

Slurp ha-ho-fihla: ['obtain'] etsa: {
	>> buffer := ea-hao str.
	ea-hao str := ['']. <- buffer.
}.


Slurp ncha hello world.
Sephetho ngola: (Slurp obtain), mola-o-mocha. 
Sephetho ngola: (Slurp obtain), mola-o-mocha. 
Slurp hello world.
>> x := Slurp ncha.
Sephetho ngola: (x obtain), mola-o-mocha. 
x hi there.
Sephetho ngola: (x obtain), mola-o-mocha. 
